  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Infinite loop in the pcre2test utility when a subject\n     line used a negative repeat count in a \\[...]{n} escape, because the\n     repeat count was rejected only when it was exactly zero\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2022-41409.patch: reject zero or negative repeat\n       counts for \\[...]{n} subject escapes in src/pcre2test.c, with test\n       coverage in testdata/testinput2 and testdata/testoutput2\n     - CVE-2022-41409",
